{"case_id":"Y01","document_id":"yescieval","type":"rubric_list","question":"YESciEval 的九个评价 rubric 按哪三个维度组织？请列出每个维度下的三个 rubric。","source_pages":{"2025.acl-long.675.pdf":[3,4]},"required_facts":["Linguistic","Stylistic","Logical","Structural","Content","Accuracy","Cohesion","Conciseness","Readability","Coherence","Integration","Relevancy","Correctness","Completeness","Informativeness"],"expected":"Linguistic & Stylistic Quality：Cohesion、Conciseness、Readability；Logical & Structural Integrity：Coherence、Integration、Relevancy；Content Accuracy & Informativeness：Correctness、Completeness、Informativeness。"}
{"case_id":"Y02","document_id":"yescieval","type":"method_detail","question":"YESciEval 为什么没有只用 adversarial 样本做强化学习偏好数据？作者后来怎样调整数据组成？","source_pages":{"2025.acl-long.675.pdf":[6,7]},"required_facts":["adversarial","benign","poor examples"],"answer_fact_aliases":{"poor examples":["差样本","不良示例","低质量示例"]},"expected":"仅用 adversarial 偏好数据时，RL 倾向模仿差示例，也难以模仿 benign 综合回答的评估；作者另外构造同时含 benign 与 adversarial 示例的偏好数据，并基于 adversarial 评估的不理想结果挑选 bad 示例。"}
{"case_id":"Y03","document_id":"yescieval","type":"scope_boundary","question":"YESciEval 所说的 cost-free 是否表示无需研究者时间和 GPU/算力？它具体免除了哪些成本？","source_pages":{"2025.acl-long.675.pdf":[3,6]},"required_facts":["human annotation","proprietary API","compute"],"answer_fact_aliases":{"human annotation":["人工标注","人工反馈"],"proprietary API":["专有 API","商业 API","专有模型"],"compute":["算力","GPU","计算资源"]},"expected":"不是。论文将 cost-free 限定为没有人工标注/反馈和专有 API 或模型服务的货币成本；运行开源模型仍需要研究者时间和计算资源，文中也明确提到 GPU compute。"}
